# Terraform working files
**/.terraform/*
.terraform.lock.hcl
crash.log
crash.*.log
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json

# State and plans (contain secrets such as generated SSH private keys and resource IDs)
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfplan
tfplan

# Environment-specific variable values
*.auto.tfvars
*.auto.tfvars.json
private.tfvars

# Generated locally by examples/cc_pls (private key, ssh_config with resource IDs, proxy helper)
*.pem
*.key
examples/ssh_config
examples/bastion-proxy.sh

# Claude Code files
CLAUDE.md
CLAUDE.local.md
**/CLAUDE.md
**/CLAUDE.local.md
.claude/

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
